B.aew=new A.aM("Honey: source gives no quantity, frequency or duration.",!1)
B.afe=new A.aM("Nasal care: cool-mist humidifier and sterile saline drops/spray.",!1)
B.af9=new A.aM("Postinfectious cough: no benefit from inhaled steroids, bronchodilators or oral medicines.",!1)
B.afm=new A.aM("Keep the child away from tobacco smoke.",!1)
B.aeL=new A.aM("Menthol/camphor/eucalyptus rubs may ease cough/congestion but can irritate skin, eyes and nose.",!1)
B.aeO=new A.aM("Fever/discomfort only; omit if comfortable.",!0)
B.afb=new A.aM("Recognise possible abuse; assess/treat injuries and provide objective medical information. Do not assign blame or try to prove maltreatment.",!0)
B.afs=new A.aM("Prevent recurrent UTI: ask about constipation, daytime wetting and withholding; treat bowel/bladder dysfunction. Hydrate; void every 3-4 hours. Cranberry prevention lacks evidence.",!0)
B.aeA=new A.aM("Physiological short stature: medically well. Constitutional delay usually needs reassurance; familial short stature needs realistic expectations and explanation that no disease underlies it.",!0)
B.aeB=new A.aM(u.l,!0)
B.af4=new A.aM(u.b,!0)
B.afn=new A.aM(u.L,!0)
B.aeN=new A.aM("Assess for associated clavicle fracture, sternoclavicular injury or neurovascular injury before calling it a sprain.",!0)
B.afE=new A.aM("Treating-service regimen: refer before starting.",!0)
B.aeu=new A.aM("Max 4 g/24 h (adult); 60 mg/kg/24 h (child). Overdose can cause severe liver injury; take extra care in children and older adults.",!0)
B.afC=new A.aM("MSF reassurance on pregnancy, breastfeeding and aspirin allergy.",!1)
B.aeV=new A.aM("Purulent sputum alone does not establish bacterial infection or justify antibiotics.",!0)
B.aex=new A.aM("Max 5 consecutive days.",!0)
B.afl=new A.aM("Max 8 sprays/24 h (adults); 4 sprays/24 h (children).",!0)
B.afB=new A.aM("Contraindicated: MAO inhibitors (past 2 weeks), narrow-angle glaucoma, acute coronary disease or cardiac asthma, rhinitis sicca, post-transsphenoidal hypophysectomy.",!0)
B.aev=new A.aM("Caution: coronary heart disease, hypertension, hyperthyroidism, diabetes; prostatic enlargement with difficulty urinating.",!0)
B.aeU=new A.aM("Max 4 g/day (adults); 60 mg/kg/day (children).",!0)
B.aeZ=new A.aM("Frequency from practice; label gives no spray count or schedule.",!0)
B.aeQ=new A.aM("Blood-stained sputum: urgent work-up.",!0)
B.afg=new A.aM("Large-volume purulent sputum: assess bronchiectasis; refer.",!0)
B.aeP=new A.aM("Persistent symptoms + weight loss/night sweats: TB work-up before/alongside antibiotics.",!0)
B.aeJ=new A.aM("Penicillin allergy: avoid.",!0)
B.afv=new A.aM("Severe renal impairment: reduce dose.",!0)
B.aep=new A.aM("Glandular fever: rash risk.",!0)
B.af5=new A.aM("Suspected diphtheria or deep-space abscess: immediate intervention.",!0)
B.afD=new A.aM("Peritonsillar abscess/suppurative complication: hospital care; drainage/IV treatment.",!0)
B.af2=new A.aM("Honey: never under 1 year (infant botulism risk). Source gives no quantity, frequency or duration.",!0)
B.aeX=new A.aM("Count all paracetamol toward the daily maximum.",!0)
B.aes=new A.aM("Severe acute malnutrition: 10 mg/kg/dose; max 3 doses/24 h.",!0)
B.afk=new A.aM("Dengue with warning signs: 10 mg/kg/dose, 3-4 times daily.",!0)
B.af1=new A.aM("Hepatic impairment: caution.",!0)
B.aft=new A.aM("Uncomplicated viral cold/acute bronchitis: no routine antibiotics or antivirals.",!0)
B.aet=new A.aM("Assess for GAS pharyngitis, severe acute otitis media, or sinusitis lasting over 10 days/worsening after initial improvement; these need a different pathway.",!0)
B.aen=new A.aM("Avoid OTC cough/cold preparations in children under 12; they have no proven benefit and overdoses can be fatal. Sources give different lower age cut-offs.",!0)
B.aeS=new A.aM("Under 6 years: cough/cold medicines carry risk; antihistamine/decongestant overdose can be fatal.",!0)
B.afc=new A.aM("Codeine: do not use in children.",!0)
B.aey=new A.aM("Dextromethorphan: no proven benefit in children. Formulary permits syrup from 6 years and contraindicates tablets below 12; clinical sources disagree. Not offered here.",!0)
B.afr=new A.aM("Benzonatate: safety/effectiveness unestablished; not advised under 10 years.",!0)
B.ael=new A.aM("Assess urgently: abnormal observations, hypoxia/blue lips, altered consciousness, vomiting, recurrent pneumonia, immunocompromise, dysphagia or poor intake.",!0)
B.afu=new A.aM("Sudden cough/choking: urgently assess for an inhaled foreign body.",!0)
B.aek=new A.aM("Suspected pneumonia: chest X-ray and full blood count; CRP selectively. CRP over 30 mg/L supports pneumonia in the right clinical context. Uncomplicated cold, acute bronchitis, acute rhinosinusitis or allergic rhinitis: no routine tests without complication signs.",!0)
B.afa=new A.aM("Under 2 years + wheeze/crackles, tachypnoea or chest indrawing: assess bronchiolitis.",!0)
B.afz=new A.aM("Wet cough for 4 weeks or more: assess protracted bacterial bronchitis; do not start its antibiotic course at the first acute-cough visit.",!0)
B.af6=new A.aM("Aspirin allergy: paracetamol is a preferred option.",!1)
B.af_=new A.aM("High fever, pharyngitis/tonsillitis, otitis, cervical adenopathy, wheeze, productive cough or dyspnoea: assess for complications or another diagnosis.",!0)
B.afi=new A.aM("Severe acute otitis media, sinusitis over 10 days or worsening after initial improvement: assess for antibiotics. Otherwise no routine antibiotics.",!0)
B.aeG=new A.aM("Never use SABA alone; prescribe an ICS with it, at every age.",!0)
B.afj=new A.aM("Not for acute relief.",!0)
B.aeq=new A.aM("Give IM adrenaline immediately for airway, breathing or circulation compromise.",!0)
B.afw=new A.aM("IV adrenaline: specialist setting and experienced clinician only. Persistent breathing/circulation problems after 2 IM doses: seek expert help.",!0)
B.aff=new A.aM("Lie flat, legs raised; sit up if breathlessness dominates. Do not stand or walk abruptly.",!0)
B.afx=new A.aM("Call resuscitation team/ambulance; arrange emergency assessment.",!0)
B.afd=new A.aM("Steroids: not for routine anaphylaxis treatment.",!0)
B.aeM=new A.aM("Never delay adrenaline, fluids or adrenaline infusion for hydrocortisone.",!0)
B.aeo=new A.aM("Never prioritise corticosteroids over adrenaline.",!0)
B.af0=new A.aM("Risk-stratify hospital observation; a senior clinician decides further treatment and duration.",!0)
B.afp=new A.aM("14 days yields higher eradication than 7 days.",!1)
B.aeD=new A.aM("Continue omeprazole 20 mg twice daily with either regimen.",!0)
B.afo=new A.aM("Tetracycline binds fetal bone/teeth: contraindicated in pregnancy/breastfeeding; defer eradication or refer.",!0)
B.aeR=new A.aM("First-line avoids clarithromycin. Guidelines use a 15% local resistance cutoff for empirical triple therapy; Egypt\u2019s rate is undocumented.",!0)
B.aeI=new A.aM("Avoid alcohol with metronidazole; take tetracycline with a full glass of water.",!0)
B.afq=new A.aM("BISPYLLER/TRIGASTCARE: 650\u2013800 EGP. Cheaper Egyptian options exist, but resistance makes them non-preferred first-line.",!1)
B.af7=new A.aM("Use omeprazole with either regimen, not both; the regimens are alternatives.",!0)
B.aez=new A.aM("Use only if clarithromycin susceptibility is confirmed or local resistance is <15%; Egypt\u2019s rate is undocumented.",!0)
B.aem=new A.aM("Give all 3 together for the full course. Clarithromycin/amoxicillin alone fails to eradicate H. pylori and selects resistance.",!0)
