B.aeW=new A.aM("Type I\u2013II: conservative care and reassess recovery; specialist review may not be needed.",!0)
B.aer=new A.aM("Type III\u2013VI: orthopaedic/sports-medicine assessment; IV\u2013VI usually need surgery.",!0)
B.afA=new A.aM("Assess for associated clavicle fracture, sternoclavicular injury or neurovascular injury.",!0)
B.afy=new A.aM("Antibiotics only if bacterial etiology is suspected.",!0)
